## Client & organisation work

<sub>Systems I built for real clients — a women's-health-tech community in China, an Auckland food festival, a Delaware startup, New Zealand's leading women-in-STEM charity, and an independent Māori-led AI research commission — all still running today. I'm FemTech Weekend's CTO, GAVIGO's Founding Principal Engineer, and She Sharp's Senior Full Stack Engineer & Website Team Lead.</sub>

{{> project-cards _clientCardProjects}}
{{#if _commissionedProjects.length}}
<table>
  <colgroup>
    <col style="width:72px">
    <col style="width:200px">
    <col>
  </colgroup>
{{#each _commissionedProjects}}  <tr>
    <td>{{#if logo}}<img src="{{logo}}" height="48" alt="{{name}}" title="{{name}}">{{else}}&nbsp;{{/if}}</td>
    <td><strong><a href="{{default url repoUrl}}">{{briefTagline name}}</a></strong>{{#if _affiliationOrg}}<br><sub><a href="{{_affiliationOrg.url}}"><picture><source media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" srcset="{{default _affiliationOrg.logoDark _affiliationOrg.logoLight}}"><img src="{{_affiliationOrg.logoLight}}" height="20" alt="{{_affiliationOrg.name}}"></picture> {{_affiliationOrg.name}}</a></sub>{{/if}}</td>
    <td>{{#if narrative.impactHeadline}}<em>{{narrative.impactHeadline}}</em>{{else}}{{briefTagline tagline}}{{/if}}</td>
  </tr>
{{/each}}</table>
{{/if}}

{{#if _moreCommissionedProjects.length}}
